e,"notes":"","priority":2,"profile":"native-v1","revision":3,"schema_ref":"urn:bead-rs:schema:issue:native-v1","title":"org-rule-guard: install.sh contract (idempotency, --wire, --uninstall ownership check) has no tests","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:32:32.662180257Z"},"record_type":"issue"}
{"issue":{"assignee":"claude-code-glm-5.3-flash-glm-tradegraph","base_status":"in_progress","claim_epoch":2,"comments":[],"created_at":"2026-09-15T15:20:35.545205355Z","data":{"needle-attempts":{"schema_ref":"urn:needle:schema:attempt-history:v1","value":{"attempts":[{"adapter":"claude-code-glm-5.3-flash","attempt_id":"01a0a5b2-9e4c-7893-9383-a6fbf0f0c401","commits":["2559cb0f0d083ec3d4aec4a3d8213968a32d99d6","798be21ed43e75c0e75821a6beca10e4f862f22d"],"duration_ms":2207576,"exit_code":0,"failure_summary":"agent stream ended with terminal_reason=api_error\n\nstderr (tail):\n⚠ claude.ai connectors are disabled because ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or another auth source is set and takes precedence over your claude.ai login · Unset it to load your organization's connectors\n[claude-code:unrecognized_model] {\"model\":\"glm-5.3-flash\",\"query_source\":\"generate_session_title\"}","model":"glm-5.3-flash","outcome":"work_failure","recorded_at":"2026-09-15T16:09:09.274Z","requested_action":"released:dispatch_failed","schema_version":1,"terminal_reason":"exit_code:0","worker":"claude-code-glm-5.3-flash-glm-armor"}],"schema_version":1,"total_attempts":1}}},"description":"Both hooks have documented unittest suites (test_credential_guard.py, test_org_rule_guard.py), but `bin/bao-as` — the AppRole login wrapper whose whole job is keeping secret-store tokens out of argv — has no test mentioned anywhere in plan.md. Add a unittest suite that, using a stub `bao` binary on PATH and a temp BAO config dir, verifies: credentials reach the login only via `@file` (never as argv literals), the token is exported only into the child's environment and never printed, `exec` passthrough preserves exit code and stdio, and missing or world-readable credential files fail closed. Fixtures must be built at runtime so no credential-shaped literal sits in the test file, matching the convention of the two existing suites.\n\n---\nPriority: P2\nCreated by: weave strand","external_references":[],"id":"util-b65ff1a9","issue_type":"task","labels":["failure-count:1","quarantine-until:2026-09-15T16:14:09.145209517+00:00","weave-generated"],"manual_blocked":false,"notes":"","priority":2,"profile":"native-v1","revision":4,"schema_ref":"urn:bead-rs:schema:issue:native-v1","title":"agent-secrets: bin/bao-as is the only documented component with no test suite","updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:29:24.371196672Z"},"record_type":"issue"}
